<section class="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
	<p class="faq-title" data-i18n-key="faq_title">Questions</p>
	<div class="faq-item">
		<p class="faq-question" data-i18n-key="faq_q_safe">Is this safe?</p>
		<p class="faq-answer" data-i18n-key="faq_a_safe">
			Your message goes directly from your device to WhatsApp. We do not store the phone
			number or the message.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="faq-item">
		<p class="faq-question" data-i18n-key="faq_q_install">Do I need to install anything?</p>
		<p class="faq-answer" data-i18n-key="faq_a_install">
			No. You only need WhatsApp on your phone or the WhatsApp Web / Desktop app on your
			computer.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="faq-item">
		<p class="faq-question" data-i18n-key="faq_q_devices">
			Does it work on phone and computer?
		</p>
		<p class="faq-answer" data-i18n-key="faq_a_devices">
			Yes. On a phone it opens your WhatsApp app. On a computer it opens WhatsApp Web or the
			WhatsApp Desktop app if you have it installed.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
